    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Regimens\" title=\"Force Regimens\">Force Regimens</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vo%27ren_Faalo\" title=\"Vo'ren Faalo\">Vo'ren Faalo</a></i> </p><p>In Vo'ren's fifth and final cadence, you must demonstrate true mastery over yourself and your&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>. No wax cylinders are required; you simply know when you have made a correct strike. Unlike the other cadences, this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Regimen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Regimen\">Force Regimen</a> requires you to use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> to manipulate your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>, an act of pure telekinetic power in which your hands never touch the weapon. This technique brings together the Control, Sense, and Alter aspects of The Force into one training regimen. </p><p><b>Time:</b> 3 Hours </p><p><b>Targets:</b> Self </p><p><b>Requirements:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> </p><p><b>Make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check.</b> You take a penalty on your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>. The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen: </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DC </th> \n   <th> </th> \n   <th>EFFECT </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>31-36 </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>You make a mistake during the first hour. You gain a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks made to use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Light_Object\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Light Object\">Move Light Object</a> application of the skill. </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>37-42 </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>You make a mistake during the second hour. You gain a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks made to use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Light_Object\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Light Object\">Move Light Object</a> application of the skill. </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>43+ </td> \n   <td> </td> \n   <td>You complete the cadence without making a single mistake. You gain a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks made to use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Light_Object\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Light Object\">Move Light Object</a> application of the skill, and you add the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kinetic_Combat\" title=\"Kinetic Combat\">Kinetic Combat</a></i> Force Power to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a>. Additionally, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to reroll any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check made to activate a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> with the [<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Telekinetic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Telekinetic\">Telekinetic</a></i>] descriptor, keeping the better of the two results. </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
